Implemented on branch `feature/issue-264` and committed as `37b9b96` (`Revamp deploy request mobile decision flow`).

The mobile deploy request page now follows a cleaner 4-step stack in [`src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx:92`](/private/tmp/pp-264/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx#L92) and [`src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx:3222`](/private/tmp/pp-264/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx#L3222): context, risk, action, then evidence. I moved the action block above evidence, removed the extra mobile snapshot/progress/nav chrome, shortened the section framing, and kept the evidence behind accordions so approve/deny is reachable much sooner on small screens. The main action zone is now centered around the sign/reject controls in [`src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx:3306`](/private/tmp/pp-264/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx#L3306), with evidence following in [`src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx:3477`](/private/tmp/pp-264/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx#L3477).

Verification: direct ESLint passed on the edited file via `./node_modules/.bin/eslint 'src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx'`. Repo-wide `./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit` still fails, but only due unrelated pre-existing errors elsewhere in the codebase. PR creation could not be completed because this environment has no network access to GitHub (`gh pr create` failed connecting to `api.github.com`).
